<unit id="af4cdc03-4510-4daa-8149-7e656504045c">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 18</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>This Addon allows NVDA users to review a Window content in a text box, similar to window virtualization of JAWS for Windows.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="07d5d861-3735-42ff-b4c8-e64a5b736d50">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 19</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Note, however, that this is just a convenience for users and does not replace NVDA's excellent review modes and object navigation support.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="f79dc509-4232-41a0-810f-6b10db6f006d">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 21</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Usage</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="5e3fbd44-355a-4161-8ec8-8dab52875201">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 22</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Press NVDA+control+w to open the virtual revision Window.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="5aa410c9-5041-46c0-8963-7749722870b1">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 23</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Then simply navigate the shown textbox as you do in any other text content.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="2ca766bf-d891-4ca0-ab72-c8a850477f5e">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 24</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>You can press Escape to close the virtual revision window.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
